   115	  without a saved passing gate; the worker limit fits the memory limit. All pass: `uv run pytest -q docs/revision/churn`
   116	  (19 passed).
   117	- **(c) The p = 0 gate, first on the pod.** The driver runs fresh0 R3 D2+H3 at p = 0 through the injected path (inputs,
   118	  search, freeze, acceptance, evaluation, doubling) into `gate-p0/`, maps the id `|churn0` to the registered id, and
   119	  compares search and evaluation by the reset driver's `compare` and the doubling check by `compare_doubling`
